/fuzz/target
# Fuzzer state is machine-local and regenerable: the seed corpus is produced
# by `cargo test -p nsif-format --test corpus -- --ignored`, and any crash the
# fuzzer finds is promoted to a regression test in tests/reject.rs rather than
# being carried here as a binary blob.
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/Cargo.lock
fuzz-*.log
